<title>USA: Parlux arranges $25 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Parlux arranges $25 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parlux Fragrances Inc said on Tuesday it signed a commitment letter with GE Capital Services for a $25 million senior secured revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>The facility will be used for working capital and general corporate purposes, including repaying the company's current $10 million facility, Parlux said. The new facility if finalized would more than double the amount of financing available to the company.</p>
<p>GE Capital Services is a unit of General Electric Co.</p>
</text>
